00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.342 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Julia Peccia habite à

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.409 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Est. Elle doit

00:00:07.607 --> 00:00:10.477 size:53% position:73% line:53%
traverser en voiture de 4

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:11.511 size:53% position:73% line:53%
