00:00:09.743 --> 00:00:12.579 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Louis-Hippolyte-La Fontaine

00:00:10.744 --> 00:00:13.680 size:53% position:73% line:53%
pour se rendre sur son lieu

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:14.748 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de travail à Bro

00:00:12.913 --> 00:00:15.815 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La fermeture partielle du pont

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:16.850 size:53% position:73% line:53%
l'oblige à changer d'itinéraire.

00:00:15.082 --> 00:00:17.918 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JULIA PECCIA, résidente de

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.985 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Montréal-Est

00:00:17.184 --> 00:00:21.521 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- L'autobus 189 au coin

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:22.556 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la rude la rude la rude la r,

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:23.623 size:53% position:73% line:53%
le métro jusqu'à Berri-UQAM.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.658 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ensuite, la ligne orange

00:00:22.889 --> 00:00:25.959 size:53% position:73% line:53%
