00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:28.495 size:53% position:73% line:53%
là, j'en ai pas d'alternatives

00:00:26.293 --> 00:00:29.763 size:53% position:73% line:53%
vraiment. J'aimerais ça le

00:00:27.561 --> 00:00:31.031 size:53% position:73% line:53%
